  "description": "Chemical Guys C4 & P4 Clear Cut Correcting Compound and... - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Chemical Guys C4 & P4 Clear Cut Correcting Compound and... - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Chemical Guys C4 & P4 Clear Cut Correcting Compound and Precision Paint Perfection Polish Combo - Removes Scratches, Swirls, Towel Marks, Etching and Restores Gloss - 2 x 16 oz - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Chemical Guys C4 & P4 Clear Cut Correction Compound and Precision Paint Perfection Polish Combo (GAP40016) provides a complete 2-step paint repair system for restoring and completing automotive finishes.C4 Clear Cut Correction Compound is designed to provide maximum cutting power to remove deep scratches, heavy swirls, oxidation, towel marks, and acid rain etching. Its advanced polish prepares the surface to level the paint quickly and effectively while minimizing dust and residue.P4 Precision Paint Perfection Polish is a refining process that improves depth, gloss, and color clarity. Removes microscopic marine, holograms, and light hazes left behind during formulation for a mirror-like show quality finish.Safe for use on clear coat, single stage and ceramic coated vehicles. Both products are compatible with dual action and rotary polishers or hand applications. Whether you're restoring left paint or maintaining a showcar in your garage, the C4 & P4 system provides professional level corrections and shine in an easy-to-use package",
